<title>SWITZERLAND: Ciba SC to report Q1 data May 28.</title>
<headline>Ciba SC to report Q1 data May 28.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ciba Specialty Chemicals Inc said it would report sales for the first quarter of 1997 and supplementary financial information related to its spin-off from Novartis on May 28.</p>
<p>It said it would release the information before the Swiss Exchange opens at 0800 GMT, but it did not give a specific time.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
